--- documentation_generation_process
step | task | description | input | output | priority
1 | Create_Doc_Files | Generate .md for each use case | Source code | .md files | high
2 | Add_Explanations | Include case use descriptions | Feature analysis | Text content | high
3 | Add_Diagrams | Include Mermaid diagrams | Flow analysis | Diagram code | high
4 | Update_README | Create/update main README | Documentation index | README.md | high
5 | Add_Navigation_Links | Link to docs folder | Doc files list | Links section | medium
6 | Add_Commands_Section | Document run/test/build commands | Package.json | Commands | high
7 | Add_Headers_Badges | Create intro header with badges | Project metadata | Badge section | medium

--- diagram_types_available
diagram_type | usage | use_case | mermaid_syntax | when_to_use
flowchart | Process visualization | Feature flows, workflows | flowchart TD | Logic and processes
sequence | Interaction timing | Service calls, message flow | sequenceDiagram | Component interactions
architecture | System design | Module relationships | graph TB | System overview
entity_relationship | Data models | Database schema | erDiagram | Data structures
component | Module breakdown | System components | graph TD | Architecture layers

--- readme_header_components
component | type | examples | purpose | required
Title | H1 heading | # PCO Web Portal Front | Project identification | true
Badges | HTML/Markdown | ![Build](url), ![Coverage](url) | Key metrics/status | true
Description | Paragraphs | Purpose, features, audience | Project overview | true
Quick_Links | Links | [Docs](docs/), [API](docs/api.md) | Navigation | false
Technology_Stack | List | React, Angular, Node.js | Technical info | false
Commands_Section | Code block | npm start, npm test | How to run | true

--- documentation_content_rules
rule | applies_to | requirement | example | violation
No_Invention | All docs | Use only existing code | Document actual functions | Documenting non-existent features
Brief_Explanations | Use cases | 1-3 sentences per feature | Clear use case description | Multi-page explanation
Diagram_Explanations | Diagrams | Explain each diagram | Diagram + text explanation | Diagram only
Link_Structure | Navigation | Organize with clear links | Table of contents | Scattered references
Consistency | All | Same format/style | Unified heading levels | Mixed formatting

--- readme_commands_section
command | section | purpose | example_format | for_developers
npm start | Getting Started | Start dev server | npm start or yarn start | true
npm test | Testing | Run unit tests | npm test --watch | true
npm run test:cov | Testing | Generate coverage report | npm run test:cov | true
npm run build | Building | Production build | npm run build --prod | true
npm run lint | Code Quality | Run linter | npm run lint --fix | true
ng serve | Development | Angular dev server | ng serve --open | true
ng test | Testing | Angular test runner | ng test --browsers=Chrome | true
ng build | Building | Angular build | ng build --configuration production | true
